  dialogueLines:
  - AAAHHH!!!
  - You! Yeah, you! You're meant to be graduating today, right?
  - You gotta help! There's a Minerrage in the castle to the north, where you were
    meant to graduate, and it's on a rampage!
  - Please defeat it and talk to me once you do!
  - Yay!
  - You defeated the Minerrage! I'm so grateful!
  - Unfortunately, that's all we have for the demo of Monsters And Rangers.
  - Please check out the finished version when it releases!
